---
// src/pages/refund-policy.astro
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

import { LEGAL } from "@/data/legal";
---

<LegalLayout title="Returns & Refund Policy"
description=""
>
  <p>
    This policy lasts 3 days from the date your order has been delivered. If 3
    days have gone by since then, unfortunately we cannot offer you a refund or
    exchange.
  </p>

  <p>
    To be eligible for a return, the artwork must be in the same condition that
    you received it. It must also be in the original packaging and include the
    certificate of authenticity. Please contact me via email at <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> if there is an issue.
  </p>

  <p>Non-returnable items:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissioned works</li>
    <!-- <li>Murals</li> -->
  </ul>

  <p>
    Once your return is received and inspected, I will send you an email to
    notify you that I have received your returned artwork. I will also notify
    you of the approval or rejection of your refund. Any item not in its original
    condition, or that is damaged or lost in transit for reasons not due to my
    error, will not be refunded.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you are approved, then your refund will be processed back to your original
    method of payment within 3-5 business days.
  </p>

  <h2>sale artworks</h2>
  <p>
    Unfortunately, artworks purchased at a sale price cannot be refunded or
    exchanged.
  </p>

  <h2>painting commissions</h2>
  <p>
    Due to the personalised nature of commissions, refunds or returns cannot be
    offered if you are unhappy with the final artwork. Before painting begins, we
    will work together to confirm the chosen subject, composition, colour palette
    and overall concept, to ensure you are happy with the direction of the piece.
  </p>
  <p>Once painting has commenced, no refunds or cancellations can be made.</p>
  <p>
    If your artwork arrives damaged during transit, please contact me within 24
    hours of delivery and provide photographs of both the artwork and the
    packaging. The artwork must be returned to me before a refund or replacement
    can be issued. Return instructions will be provided upon contact.
  </p>

  <h2>artwork exchange</h2>
  <p>
    I accept change of mind exchanges. For instance, if you purchase an artwork
    and you feel it doesn't suit the aesthetic of your home and you wish to
    exchange it for another artwork. The artwork will need to be returned to me
    first, in the original packaging, including the certificate of authenticity,
    and in the original condition it arrived in. If a return should arrive back
    to me damaged, or the artwork becomes lost in transit, I will not be
    responsible for providing an exchange or refund.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please contact me at <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a>
   {" "} should you wish to exchange an artwork.
  </p>

  <h2>damaged artworks</h2>
  <p>
    If an artwork is defective or damaged upon arrival, please contact me at
   {" "} <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> with photos of the damage
    as close to the time of arrival as possible. Contact made after 24 hours of
    arrival regarding damage will not be considered my responsibility.
    <em>Please</em> check your artwork when it arrives to ensure there is no
    damage.
  </p>
  <p>
    For damaged original artworks a full refund can be provided. You will first
    need to return the damaged artwork back to me in the original packaging,
    including the certificate of authenticity. Return tracking will need to be
    provided to me as proof. Once the item has been received, a refund will be
    provided back to the original payment source.
  </p>
  <p>
    For limited-edition prints, you can opt for a full refund, or replacement.
    You will first need to return the damaged artwork back to me in the original
    packaging, including the certificate of authenticity. Return tracking will
    need to be provided to me as proof. Once the item has been received, a refund
    or replacement will be provided.
  </p>
  <p>
    If return tracking is not provided to me as proof of return, and the artwork
    becomes lost in transit, no refund or exchange will be provided.
  </p>

  <h2>shipping</h2>
  <p>
    You will be responsible for paying for your own shipping costs for returning
    an artwork. Shipping costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the
    cost of return shipping will be deducted from your refund.
  </p>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, the time it may take for your exchange artwork
    to reach you may vary.
  </p>
  <p>
    A traceable shipping service MUST be used for return items. I recommend
    purchasing shipping insurance as well but it is not mandatory. I don't
    guarantee that I will receive your returned artwork.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please contact me at <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> to
    confirm a return address.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>